stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Document renderer states
  accDescr: The renderer starts idle and parses when the user types; a valid source is rendered and an invalid one shows an error; it returns to idle when rendering completes or when the user edits after an error.
  direction LR
  [*] --> Idle
  %% declared before the forward path so its return runs above Parsing and does not cross "source invalid"
  Rendering --> Idle : render completes
  Idle --> Parsing : user types
  Parsing --> Rendering : source valid
  Parsing --> Error : source invalid
  Error --> Idle : user edits
